tags: access

A setting of a slot of the API: how a third party reaches the slot. The value is
direct, tunnel or any. The default is any.

The node enforces it in the tunnel only. A direct connection does not go through the
node, so for it the value tunnel is a declaration for the callers. A node refuses a
service that has wake=on_tunnel or tunnel_auth=address on a slot with access=direct.

=== formal
default=any
place=api.slot
setting=access
values=any,direct,tunnel
